{"id":"a3756ca9ffc3a52a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/567_模态谓词逻辑.md","title":"567 模态谓词逻辑","display":"567_模态谓词逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{567}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{567}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>谓词签名为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal R_{567},\\operatorname{ar}_{567}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}_{567}:\\mathcal R_{567}\\to\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathcal R_{567},\\operatorname{ar}_{567}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}_{567}:\\mathcal R_{567}\\to\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项只有变量项：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}=\\mathsf{Var}_{567},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{var}_{567}(x)=x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}=\\mathsf{Var}_{567},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{var}_{567}(x)=x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel},\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall,\\Box\">\\(\\operatorname{rel},\\bot,\\neg,\\to,\\forall,\\Box\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R_{567}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R_{567}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>项自由变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{567}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{567}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{567}(x)=\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{567}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{567}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{567}(x)=\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{567}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{567})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{567}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{567})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R)}\\operatorname{FVt}_{567}(\\tau(i)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R)}\\operatorname{FVt}_{567}(\\tau(i)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{567}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{567})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{567}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{567})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(\\forall xA)=\\{x\\}\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{567}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{567}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{567})\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{567}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{567})\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{567}(X)=v_m\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{567}(X)=v_m\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}\\)</span>。项替换函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subt}_{567}:\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{567},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Subt}_{567}:\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Tm}_{567},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z[x:=y]\">\\(z[x:=y]\\)</span>，并定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z[x:=y]=\n\\begin{cases}\ny,&amp;z=x,\\\\\nz,&amp;z\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z[x:=y]=\n\\begin{cases}\ny,&amp;z=x,\\\\\nz,&amp;z\\ne x.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{567}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{567}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=y]\">\\(A[x:=y]\\)</span>，由下列子句定义。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R_{567}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R_{567}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;),\n\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=y].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)[x:=y]=\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau&#39;),\n\\quad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\tau(i)[x:=y].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=y]=\\bot,\\quad\n(\\neg A)[x:=y]=\\neg(A[x:=y]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[x:=y]=\\bot,\\quad\n(\\neg A)[x:=y]=\\neg(A[x:=y]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)[x:=y]=A[x:=y]\\to B[x:=y],\n\\quad\n(\\Box A)[x:=y]=\\Box(A[x:=y]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to B)[x:=y]=A[x:=y]\\to B[x:=y],\n\\quad\n(\\Box A)[x:=y]=\\Box(A[x:=y]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\">\\(z\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall zB)[x:=y]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall zB,&amp;z=x,\\\\\n\\forall z(B[x:=y]),&amp;z\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ z\\ne y,\\\\\n\\forall w((B[z:=w])[x:=y]),&amp;z\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ z=y,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall zB)[x:=y]=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall zB,&amp;z=x,\\\\\n\\forall z(B[x:=y]),&amp;z\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ z\\ne y,\\\\\n\\forall w((B[z:=w])[x:=y]),&amp;z\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ z=y,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中第三行的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=\\operatorname{fresh}_{567}(\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(B)\\cup\\{x,y,z\\})\">\\(w=\\operatorname{fresh}_{567}(\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(B)\\cup\\{x,y,z\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(B)\\setminus\\{z\\}\">\\(w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(B)\\setminus\\{z\\}\\)</span>，定义外层绑定变量改名</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{567}(\\forall zB,z,w)=\\forall w(B[z:=w]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{567}(\\forall zB,z,w)=\\forall w(B[z:=w]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{567}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{567}\\)</span> 为所有二元关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的集合，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal E_{567}\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal E_{567}\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R_{567}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R_{567}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R)=n\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,\\rho:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\">\\(\\tau,\\rho:n\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{567}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\rho\">\\(\\tau=\\rho\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\rho))\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau),\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\rho))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\">\\((\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\">\\((\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Box A,\\Box B)\\in E\">\\((\\Box A,\\Box B)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,w\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\">\\(z,w\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(B)\\setminus\\{z\\}\">\\(w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(B)\\setminus\\{z\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall zB,\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{567}(\\forall zB,z,w)\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall zB,\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{567}(\\forall zB,z,w)\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,567}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{567}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,567}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{567}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{567}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{567}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{567}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{567}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{567}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{567}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{567}=\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=y]:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{567}=\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=y]:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{567}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{567}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{567}=\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{567}=\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{567}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{567}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{567}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{567}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{567}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{567}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{567}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{567}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{567}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{567}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{567}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q1}^{567}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q2}^{567}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{567}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{567}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{567}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{567}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{567}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{567}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{567}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{567}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{567}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列六种条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{567}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{567}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{567}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{567}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\forall xA_j\">\\(A_i=\\forall xA_j\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{567}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{567}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{567}(G)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{567}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{567}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,567}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,567}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\)</span>，定义末行函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{567,\\Gamma}:\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{567}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{567,\\Gamma}:\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{567}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{567}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{567}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{567,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{567,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记上述末行函数族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{567}\n=\n(\\operatorname{last}_{567,\\Gamma})_{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{567}\n=\n(\\operatorname{last}_{567,\\Gamma})_{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{567}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{567}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{567}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{567,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{567}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{567}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{567,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-谓词片段证书\">8. 谓词片段证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"567\">\\(567\\)</span>-谓词片段证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R,\\tau)\">\\((R,\\tau)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal R_{567}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal R_{567}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\)</span>，证书公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{rel}(R,\\tau)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与满足\">9. 语义结构与满足</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"567\">\\(567\\)</span>-常域谓词 Kripke 模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QKMod}_{567}\">\\(\\mathsf{QKMod}_{567}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,R,D,I),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,R,D,I),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W\\times W\">\\(R\\subseteq W\\times W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(D\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I(w,R_0)\\subseteq D^{\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R_0)}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I(w,R_0)\\subseteq D^{\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R_0)}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_0\\in\\mathcal R_{567}\">\\(R_0\\in\\mathcal R_{567}\\)</span> 定义。赋值为函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\to D\">\\(a:\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\to D\\)</span>，项解释满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket x\\rrbracket_{567}^{\\mathcal M,a}=a(x)\">\\(\\llbracket x\\rrbracket_{567}^{\\mathcal M,a}=a(x)\\)</span>。满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}A\">\\(\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}A\\)</span> 由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}\\operatorname{rel}(R_0,\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(a(\\tau(k)))_{k&lt;\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R_0)}\\in I(w,R_0),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal M,a,w\\not\\Vdash_{567}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}\\operatorname{rel}(R_0,\\tau)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(a(\\tau(k)))_{k&lt;\\operatorname{ar}_{567}(R_0)}\\in I(w,R_0),\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal M,a,w\\not\\Vdash_{567}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M,a,w\\not\\Vdash_{567}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M,a,w\\not\\Vdash_{567}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M,a,w\\not\\Vdash_{567}A\\ \\lor\\ \\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M,a,w\\not\\Vdash_{567}A\\ \\lor\\ \\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}\\forall xA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall d\\in D\\ \\mathcal M,a[x\\mapsto d],w\\Vdash_{567}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}\\forall xA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall d\\in D\\ \\mathcal M,a[x\\mapsto d],w\\Vdash_{567}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\,(wRv\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,a,v\\Vdash_{567}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\,(wRv\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,a,v\\Vdash_{567}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{567}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,R,D,I)\\in\\mathsf{QKMod}_{567}\\ \\forall a:\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\to D\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{567}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,R,D,I)\\in\\mathsf{QKMod}_{567}\\ \\forall a:\\mathsf{Var}_{567}\\to D\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,a,w\\Vdash_{567}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目没有函数项和等词项；谓词原子的参数只能是变量，替换对象也是变量而不是项。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{MPL}_{567}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal R_{567},\\operatorname{ar}_{567},\\mathsf{Var}_{567},\\mathsf{Tm}_{567},\\mathsf{Frm}_{567},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{567},\\operatorname{FV}_{567},\\operatorname{BV}_{567},\n\\operatorname{fresh}_{567},\\operatorname{Subt}_{567},\\operatorname{Sub}_{567},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{567},\\equiv_{\\alpha,567},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{567},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{567},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{567},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{567},\\mathsf{Proof}_{567},\\operatorname{last}_{567},\\vdash_{567},\n\\mathsf{QKMod}_{567},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{567},\\Vdash_{567},\\models_{567}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{MPL}_{567}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal R_{567},\\operatorname{ar}_{567},\\mathsf{Var}_{567},\\mathsf{Tm}_{567},\\mathsf{Frm}_{567},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{567},\\operatorname{FV}_{567},\\operatorname{BV}_{567},\n\\operatorname{fresh}_{567},\\operatorname{Subt}_{567},\\operatorname{Sub}_{567},\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{567},\\equiv_{\\alpha,567},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{567},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{567},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{567},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{567},